  "section_notes": "S1 is strong (24h/5 days, all incidents, customer notice in 5 days). S2 sets a permanent 8% cap with no sales stop, which is weakened relative to the 5% limit and benefits Northwind's Hearth 10 (6.2%). S5 replaces the automatic recall at 8/100k with regulator review and discretionary recall, which is weakened and benefits Halcyon's Ember 8 (9.9). S3 (6-year retrofit) and S4 (36 months) fall within the acceptable ranges and match the red-line solution."
